OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy with
OL,6,Fshowers or longer spells of rain in
OL,7,Fthe evening. Becoming generally drier
OL,8,Fovernight but still rather cloudy with
OL,9,Fa few light showers. Brisk northerly
OL,10,Fwinds in the north.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FChance of a few light showers
OL,13,Fat first otherwise dry and rather
OL,14,Fcloudy. Some brighter spells across
OL,15,FLochaber. Rather cool.
OL,16,
OL,17,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FMainly
OL,18,Fdry although rather cloudy over the
OL,19,Fweekend, just a few light showers in
OL,20,Fthe northwest. Dry with more in the
OL,21,Fway of sunshine on Monday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
